== assertion 6: templates/database/tenancy/advisor.sql, against this cluster
   installed: cafaye.advisor_findings(p_schemas text[])
   scope, read back from the policies protect_table wrote: public, cafaye
   zero ERROR and zero WARN findings against account_users and api_keys.
   api_keys carries FIVE policies (4 from protect_table, 1 from
   protect_credential_table), so (api_keys, alpha, SELECT) holds two permissive
   policies and multiple_permissive_policies was asked about it directly.
